        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "881e9c42-5660-53fb-b9f2-31c8d8a90d4a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Social Distortion, Wolf Parade, Agent Orange\n- People: Brent Harold Liles, Arlen Thompson, Harris Newman\n- Places: Fullerton, California, Montreal, Quebec, British Columbia, Mount Zoomer, Hotel2Tango\n- Products: Face Control\n\nFacts:\n- Social Distortion is an American punk rock band that was formed in 1978 in Fullerton, California.\n- Brent Harold Liles was born on September 7, 1963.\n- Brent Harold Liles was the bassist for Social Distortion from 1981 to 1984.\n- Wolf Parade is an indie rock band that was formed in 2003 in Montreal, Quebec, by musicians from British Columbia.\n- Brent Harold Liles was the bassist for Agent Orange from 1988 to 1992.\n- Brent Harold Liles died on January 18, 2007.\n- Face Control was recorded and mixed by Wolf Parade member Arlen Thompson at Mount Zoomer.\n- Face Control was mastered by Harris Newman at Hotel2Tango.",
